---
description: "FunkSpace — Content (Markdown/MDX)"
globs: ["docs/**/*.{md,mdx}", "frontend/app/**/*.{md,mdx}"]
alwaysApply: false
---

## Authoring
- Every post has frontmatter: title, description, date, tags.
- Use fenced code blocks ``` for all code; no indented blocks.
- Keep paragraphs short; avoid claims not in source; add captions/alt text for media.

## MDX
- Prefer project MDX components (Image, Callout, Video) over raw HTML.
- Validate links; avoid dead references; run a quick spellcheck.
